{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29604","headline":"利州江潭作 · 李商隐","name":"利州江潭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神劒飞来不易销，碧潭珍重驻兰桡。\n自携明月移灯疾，欲就行云散锦遥。\n河伯轩窗通贝阙，水宫帷箔卷冰绡。\n他时燕脯无人寄，雨满空城蕙叶雕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}